></div>\n<div style=\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 224px;\"></div>\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 144px;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p></a></div>\n</blockquote>\n<p><script async src=\"//platform.instagram.com/en_US/embeds.js\"></script></p>\n<p><strong>開催日時</strong><br />\n2026年4月18日（土）・19日（日）<br />\n14：00～20：00<br />\n※雨天決行<br />\n<strong>開催場所</strong><br />\n大井町駅前中央通り（通称：どんたく通り）<br />\n<strong>交通アクセス</strong><br />\nJR・りんかい線・東急大井町線 大井町駅 徒歩1分</p>\n<p>詳しくは<a href=\"https://ooimachi.jp/news/2026/04/06/8389/\">ホームページ</a>をご確認ください。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_92953\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-92953\" class=\"size-full wp-image-92953\" src=\"https://shinagawa.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/166/2024/04/IMG_20230927_144343_edit_1284265831769656.jpg\" alt=\"大井町駅前\" width=\"1280\" height=\"960\" srcset=\"https://shinagawa.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/166/2024/04/IMG_20230927_144343_edit_1284265831769656.jpg 1280w, https://shinagawa.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/166/2024/04/IMG_20230927_144343_edit_1284265831769656-768x576.jpg 768w, https://shinagawa.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/166/2024/04/IMG_20230927_144343_edit_1284265831769656-1024x767.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-92953\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">大井町駅前</p></div>\n<p>大井町駅前ロータリーからすぐの場所から真っすぐ伸びる大井町駅前中央通りは、大井どんたくが開催される通りです。80店もの屋台が出店するそうで、大井どんたくのような盛り上がりが期待できそうです♪</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_92495\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-92495\" class=\"size-full wp-image-92495\" src=\"https://shinagawa.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/166/2024/04/IMG_20240410_152933_edit_1059692356287258.jpg\" alt=\"例大祭大井蔵王権現神社\" width=\"1280\" height=\"960\" srcset=\"https://shinagawa.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/166/2024/04/IMG_20240410_152933_edit_1059692356287258.jpg 1280w, https://shinagawa.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/166/2024/04/IMG_20240410_152933_edit_1059692356287258-768x576.jpg 768w, https://shinagawa.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/166/2024/04/IMG_20240410_152933_edit_1059692356287258-1024x767.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-92495\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">大井蔵王権現神社</p></div>\n<p>そして、4月18日（土）・19日（日）には大井町駅前中央通りからすぐ近く、徒歩1分の場所にある大井蔵王権現神社でも例大祭が開催されます♪　</p>\n<blockquote class=\"instagram-media\" data-instgrm-captioned data-instgrm-permalink=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DWjKqECk_H3/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" data-instgrm-version=\"14\" style=\" background:#FFF; border:0; border-radius:3px; box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width:500px; min-width:326px; padding:0; width:99.375%; width:-webkit-calc(100% - 2px); width:calc(100% - 2px);\">\n<div style=\"padding:16px;\"> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DWjKqECk_H3/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" style=\" background:#FFFFFF; line-height:0; padding:0 0; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; width:100%;\" target=\"_blank\"> </p>\n<div style=\" display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;\">\n<div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 40px; margin-right: 14px; width: 40px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center;\">\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-rad